# Dolby selection symbols

Official Google Material Symbols Rounded paths reused from the approved XiaomiParts implementation, pinned at `49d4db35df873165d6bd6ba09b063c7dafbac2f4`. Used symbols: auto_awesome, movie, music_note, mic and tune. Original paths and source viewports are preserved. Apache-2.0 license: material-symbols-LICENSE.txt.
